  "rng_seed": 99,
  "edition": 11,
  "description": "Tutorial lesson T5 driven with the SHIPPED pad charge scheme (PadRouter HINTS_CHARGE_*): RB cycles the acting unit, D-pad picks the target, A toggles it into the declaration, Start declares, Start rolls 2D6, X is Snap to Contact, Start confirms the charge, Start ends the phase. No cursor clicks on charge HUD buttons - with a chargeable unit armed the router owns A and Start. The Command Re-roll offer is an embedded modal Window driven by native focus, so its Keep Roll is emitted.",
